@Hopon.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

# Set phoneNumber to an existing Users.PhoneNumber in your local database.
@phoneNumber = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PASSENGER_PHONE
@code = REPLACE_WITH_DEV_ONLY_CODE
@token = REPLACE_WITH_PASSENGER_TOKEN
@driverPassword = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_DRIVER_PASSWORD
@driverToken = REPLACE_WITH_DRIVER_TOKEN

### Request OTP (Otp:ExposeCodeInResponse controls devOnlyCode; enabled by default in Development)
POST {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{phoneNumber}}"
}

### Verify OTP (copy devOnlyCode into code, then the response token into token)
POST {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{phoneNumber}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

### Passenger trips
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/my-trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Driver login (the seeded driver's plaintext password is not supplied)
POST {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/driver/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "driver1",
  "password": "{{driverPassword}}"
}

### Task 2: passenger token on driver API must return 403
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/driver/my-trip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Task 2: driver token on passenger API must return 403 (even for overlapping IDs)
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/my-trips
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Task 2: driver token on driver API returns 200 when assigned an active trip
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/driver/my-trip
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Task 2: driver cannot negotiate a hub connection or invoke JoinTrip (403)
POST {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/hubs/trip/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Task 2: driver cannot bypass negotiation using a query token (403)
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/hubs/trip?access_token={{driverToken}}

### Task 2: passenger query token still authenticates the hub (200)
POST {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/hubs/trip/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1&access_token={{token}}

### Task 2: query tokens do not authenticate API routes (401)
GET {{Hopon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/my-trips?access_token={{token}}
